                  <ComponentData>
                    <TypeId>MyModStorageComponent</TypeId>
                    <Component xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_ModStorageComponent">
                      <Storage>
                        <dictionary>
                          <item>
                            <Key>74de02b3-27f9-4960-b1c4-27351f2b06d1</Key>
                            <Value>DeltaV Settings
groups=All Drives,Boost,Efficient,Braking
------- AnyGroupName seperated by Comma --------

Hud Settings
hudPosition=topright
----- topright, topleft ------

showHeaderAndSettings=true
----- true, false -------------

